{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尊者舍利弗\n所問，出《雜阿含》阿練若事中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是名治亂倒心法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名柔軟治四大內風法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是名治火大三昧法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是名治地大法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是名治水大法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是名治內風大法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菴婆陀藥者，味\n如甘蔗，形似藕根，味亦有似石蜜者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此蟲形體似筋，連持子藏，能動諸脈，吸精出入，男蟲青白、女蟲紅赤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宋言月精"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四角皆相對也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入此三昧時，大地稍稍動也如車輪旋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於此法多生增上慢，宜應識之，此是\n菩提心初境界相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藹吉支者，起尸鬼也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矢馳反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矢馳反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矢馳反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矢馳反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "叔看反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "尊者阿難所問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "沙劇\n反"}
